{"3818280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carry the Patient Together", "steam_appid": 3818280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry the Patient</strong> is a fun and challenging 2-player co-op platformer where everything can go wrong at any moment. Together with a friend, you must carry an injured patient on a stretcher, climb upward through dangerous platforms, and somehow keep everyone alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sounds simple - until physics, momentum, and bad decisions turn every step into chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARRY TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/162043c797338b313bc8fa6b861109d4.poster.avif?t=1774265851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/162043c797338b313bc8fa6b861109d4.webm?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/162043c797338b313bc8fa6b861109d4.mp4?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOS MEETS SKILL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/b0b4a471af5504a6b048cceaa30ff089.poster.avif?t=1774265851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/b0b4a471af5504a6b048cceaa30ff089.webm?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/b0b4a471af5504a6b048cceaa30ff089.mp4?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMUNICATION IS KEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/f1a5f6ca1a0776c3da0ce49e7c01d0cc.poster.avif?t=1774265851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/f1a5f6ca1a0776c3da0ce49e7c01d0cc.webm?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/f1a5f6ca1a0776c3da0ce49e7c01d0cc.mp4?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPLIT UP WHEN YOU WANT AND SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/0d584bcf0c34138793b4813928cd39fb.poster.avif?t=1774265851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/0d584bcf0c34138793b4813928cd39fb.webm?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/0d584bcf0c34138793b4813928cd39fb.mp4?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based platforming and momentum-driven movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry, drop, and reposition the stretcher strategically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint system that keeps the challenge fair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun support, leaderboards, and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban environments that evolve as you climb higher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More environments planned after Early Access</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry the Patient</strong> is a fun and challenging 2-player co-op platformer where everything can go wrong at any moment. Together with a friend, you must carry an injured patient on a stretcher, climb upward through dangerous platforms, and somehow keep everyone alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sounds simple - until physics, momentum, and bad decisions turn every step into chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARRY TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/162043c797338b313bc8fa6b861109d4.poster.avif?t=1774265851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/162043c797338b313bc8fa6b861109d4.webm?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/162043c797338b313bc8fa6b861109d4.mp4?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOS MEETS SKILL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/b0b4a471af5504a6b048cceaa30ff089.poster.avif?t=1774265851\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/b0b4a471af5504a6b048cceaa30ff089.webm?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/extras/b0b4a471af5504a6b048cceaa30ff089.mp4?t=1774265851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMUNICATION IS