/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More environments planned after Early Access</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A fun and challenging co-op platformer where two players &quot;CARRY A PATIENT&quot; on a stretcher. Split up to overcome obstacles, coordinate your moves, and work together to get the patient safely to the destination. Communication and teamwork are the only way to reach the peak.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/700abd823d131eb309d4edb3eb832df505da01be/header.jpg?t=1774265851", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/1da08335f4b36d09214351cc385ebf023eccd9eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774265851", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818280/1da08335f4b36d09214351cc385ebf023eccd9eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774265851", "website": "https://www.palmonis.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVDIA 1050</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVDIA 3060 TI</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ahmet Emsal", "Şafak Yiğit"], "publishers": ["Palmonis"], "demos": [{"appid": 4276830, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "St